🏭 9. Production best practices
✅ 1. Use scheduled backups
velero schedule create daily-backup \
  --schedule="0 2 * * *"

👉 Daily backup at 2 AM

✅ 2. Backup specific namespaces
velero backup create prod-backup \
  --include-namespaces production
✅ 3. Store backups in different region

👉 Protect against region failure

✅ 4. Test restore regularly

👉 MOST IMPORTANT

Backup without restore = useless
✅ 5. Secure credentials
Use secrets
Don’t commit credentials to GitHub
✅ 6. Monitor backups
Use logs
Alerts for failure
